          <p>用户点开任意风险点直接回答，Agent 会继续追问，把“答得虚”的地方暴露出来。</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div className="traceFlow">
        <div>
          <strong>GitHub repo</strong>
          <span>仓库输入</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Risk points</strong>
          <span>会被问穿的问题</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Evidence viewer</strong>
          <span>代码 / README / 配置证据</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Follow-up</strong>
